# Hint frontend theme

Always design Hint as an **instrument**, not a generic AI SaaS page.

## Aesthetic
- Cool desk landing (`#f4f5f7` / `#ffffff` / ink `#15181d`) — same light tokens as `/home` and `/app`
- Charcoal product chrome (`#0b0d12`), steel/ember wash only
- Accent indigo is a chip/CTA, never a nebula or hero gradient
- IBM Plex Sans + IBM Plex Mono. Never Inter, Never Geist, never Space Grotesk
- Radii 8–12px. No 16–24px pill cards
- Glass is reserved for chrome (nav, cockpit bar, panel frames). Content stays opaque
- Lucide/SVG icons only. No emoji-as-icon

## UX
- Clickable controls are at least 44×44
- `cursor-pointer` on enabled buttons
- Visible `:focus-visible` rings
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` and `prefers-reduced-transparency`
- Badge meaning cannot rely on color alone

## UI/UX Pro Max
For new screens, run:

`python3 .cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py "<product> <keywords>" --design-system -p Hint`

## Do not
- Reintroduce mode tabs or `freelyAnswer`
- Put glass on answer body copy
- Hardcode purple scan washes (`rgba(99, 91, 255, …)`)
